      "writtenOn": "2016-06-16T11:01:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I know you have done this to try and keep last_auth always \"correct\" (i.e. it\u0027s None if they haven\u0027t authenticated yet after upgrading to Newton). However, this new solution swaps a \"temporary incorrectness\", for a larger percentage of items bering \"permanently incorrect\" - i.e. all those users created prior to Newton. I\u0027m not quite sure that\u0027s a good trade-off.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 257,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 257,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "71fab1dcfaeb2a979547ad8c48331b7129506f02",
